1
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,880
Sorry, this is a private space.

2
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,080
The cafe is out the door and to the right.

3
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,600
Business is pretty slow.

4
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,000
Can you still afford the rent?

5
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,020
None of your business.

6
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,010
It has everything to do with me.

7
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,680
Ms. Gao,

8
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,320
personally,

9
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,170
we can't change the fact
that we are father and daughter.

10
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,000
Professionally,

11
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,480
every penny spent here

12
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,880
comes from my Wending Group,

13
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,280
right?

14
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,400
Yes, Mr. Gao.

15
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,000
That's why Wending Group

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,200
froze all my cards,

17
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:07,800
isn't it?

18
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,920
I would've forgotten
if you hadn't reminded me.

19
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,520
You still have another card.

20
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,920
I'll tell finance

21
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,080
to freeze that one tomorrow too.

22
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,680
You're ruthless.

23
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:25,800
Wrong.

24
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,680
It's called cutting losses.

25
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,280
That's what you get
for breaking your promise.

26
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,480
I did keep my promise.

27
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,240
I promised to meet him,

28
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,039
not to date him.

29
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,280
Yanyan,

30
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,039
tell me,

31
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,479
how did our relationship

32
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,050
end up like this?

33
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:56,800
I came to tell you

34
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,759
to think carefully

35
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:04,160
about your relationship with Fengshu.

36
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,020
Where were you last Saturday?

37
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,200
Don't you know

38
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:19,340
where I am every Saturday?

39
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,880
You're lying.

40
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,640
So you went to the old house

41
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,600
last Saturday.

42
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:26,880
I did.

43
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,680
I searched every corner of it.

44
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,600
Where were you?

45
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,140
Did you check the wine cellar?

46
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,800
Xiao Ze,

47
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,800
is that you?

48
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,329
Stop playing tricks, will you?

49
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,600
So

50
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,880
the ticket and the note are with you?

51
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,640
At home.

52
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:33,610
Then bring them to me later.

53
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,079
You didn't go in the end, did you?

54
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,880
To be honest,

55
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,760
Xiao Ze's extreme behavior

56
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,560
only makes me reject him more.

57
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,640
So I definitely wouldn't go.

58
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:48,880
Even though I really wanted
to see that dance drama.

59
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:51,880
Can you tell us
about your past relationships?

60
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,200
That was when I was drifting in Beijing.

61
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,970
It's all in the past.

62
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,360
Is this important?

63
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,360
I don't want to mention that person.

64
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,220
Not important.

65
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:06,640
Understandable.

66
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,840
What happened next?

67
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,880
He asked you out,
you didn't go to the show,

68
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,680
so he came to negotiate with you?

69
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,960
He sent me a text.

70
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,770
Do you want to see it?

71
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,410
That would be great.

72
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,040
He threatened me with death.

73
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,560
I was scared.

74
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,800
So I went anyway.

75
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,360
I brought his threatening letter,

76
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:10,040
wanting to clear things up

77
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,580
and end it for good.

78
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:14,850
But I was so afraid
he'd do something extreme.

79
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,920
In the end, I didn't even dare
bring the letter

80
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,560
into the woods.

81
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,600
Xiao Ze,

82
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,280
is this the place?

83
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,880
Are you here?

84
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,280
Shen Xi,

85
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,960
you came.

86
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,520
Come in.

87
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,080
I'm inside.

88
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,280
Xiao Ze,

89
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,440
What exactly do you want?

90
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,640
Why didn't you go yesterday?

91
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,720
I told you I didn't want to watch it.

92
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,640
You're lying.

93
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,860
You just didn't want to go with me.

94
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,240
Xiao Ze,

95
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,440
didn't we agree

96
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,600
to just be ordinary friends?

97
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,720
I thought

98
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,440
we could start as ordinary friends.

99
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,040
But Shen Xi,

100
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,640
I realized

101
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,280
I was just deceiving myself.

102
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,600
When I see you,

103
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,640
I just can't control myself.

104
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,080
When I can't see you,

105
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,040
I miss you every single second.

106
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,240
Shen Xi,

107
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,800
be my girlfriend.

108
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,760
I felt

109
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,460
his kind of love was just too terrifying.

110
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,080
So

111
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,880
I didn't answer him then.

112
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:09,640
He said

113
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,960
if I didn't agree,

114
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,360
he would hang himself immediately.

115
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,260
So you weren't threatened by him,

116
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,480
chose to walk away,

117
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,880
and rejected him, right?

118
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:22,080
No.

119
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,640
I was afraid he'd do something stupid,

120
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:27,280
so I thought I'd calm him down first

121
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,900
and deal with it later.

122
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:33,240
But I didn't expect...

123
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,400
Xiao Ze,

124
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,200
listen to me.

125
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,480
I didn't say no.

126
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,040
I just think right now...

127
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,200
I knew it. Xiao Ze,

128
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,000
you like me, don't you?

129
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,880
You have feelings for me, right?

130
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,280
Don't.

131
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,159
I knew it.

132
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,159
You're just shy.

133
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:49,960
Let go of me.

134
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,760
Shen Xi,

135
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,280
I love you.

136
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:55,040
You don't know how much I love you.

137
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,080
Shen Xi!

138
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,840
Xiao Ze, don't do this.

139
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,280
Let go.

140
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:02,120
Xiao Ze!

141
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,880
Xiao Ze, d-don't do this.

142
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,600
I-I'm leaving.

143
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:17,480
Shen Xi, come back.

144
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,480
If you keep doing this, I'll kill myself.

145
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:28,160
It matches the timeline
Shen Xi described perfectly.

146
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,840
This surveillance footage is from
the front of the hot pot restaurant.

147
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:33,159
She fled the woods at this time.

148
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:36,480
It should be 3:31.

149
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,480
Based on her running speed

150
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:41,400
and the distance
from the restaurant to the woods,

151
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,799
she must have just fled the woods

152
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,160
around

153
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:48,000
3:25.

154
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,000
At this spot,

155
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,280
after fleeing the woods,

156
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,640
she was probably terrified,

157
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,480
rested here for a while,

158
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,820
and then got in the car.

159
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,000
This is the earlier video.

160
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,040
The time is 3:03.

161
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,800
It should be when she arrived
at the hot pot restaurant.

162
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:05,130
the time she was getting ready
to go to the woods for the date.

163
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,520
Here,

164
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,760
her expression of panic
and fleeing is quite obvious.

165
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
Look, she's looking back while running.

166
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,240
She was probably afraid
Xiao Ze would catch up.

167
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,000
Her legs even gave out in the middle,

168
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,480
and she paused for a moment.

169
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,120
I asked Song Yanfei before.

170
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,400
The tickets for their dance drama

171
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:22,680
sold out

172
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,660
as soon as they were released.

173
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,170
But look at this,

174
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,680
Xiao Ze managed to get two.

175
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,120
Right,

176
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:35,920
didn't we see Xiao Ze
at the venue that day?

177
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,300
Captain Li,

178
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,560
Xiao Ze is in the back.

179
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,960
Who is Xiao Ze?

180
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:54,480
Why is he here?

181
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,680
I have no idea.

182
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,000
Wei said he just got out on bail

183
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,880
and came to see the show today.

184
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,170
This guy has a good mindset.

185
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,080
Not bad.

186
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,080
You're getting along well with Wei.

187
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,120
Keep it up.

188
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,680
Should we go say a few words to Xiao Ze?

189
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:16,480
Are you crazy?

190
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,840
We're traffic police.

191
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,300
It's none of our business.

192
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,260
Isn't the task force's case
already closed?

193
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,700
Xiao Ze is leaving. He's leaving.

194
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,280
Don't you think today's show

195
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,610
is a bit different
from what we saw before?

196
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,600
Of course it's different.

197
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,480
Before was a rehearsal.

198
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,360
Today is the official performance.

199
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,160
Even though it's a small-scale preview,

200
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:04,690
it's definitely different
from a rehearsal.

201
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,260
That's not what I mean.

202
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,960
I just feel like something is...

203
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,680
off.

204
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,440
Captain Li,

205
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,360
you really have an art background.

206
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,840
Amateurs watch the fun,

207
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,370
but experts see the tricks.

208
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,680
I didn't notice anything at all.

209
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,010
It'd be weird if you did.

210
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,840
What's different?

211
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,920
Captain Li, Captain Weng,

212
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:35,480
our shift is over.

213
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,200
We're heading out.

214
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:36,600
We're heading out.

215
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,280
Bye.

216
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:38,440
Captain Li,

217
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,480
the test results

218
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,880
are in.

219
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,360
Based on the note Shen Xi provided,

220
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,440
the forensics department compared it...

221
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,970
It's confirmed
that Xiao Ze wrote it himself.

222
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,200
Now,

223
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,240
the surveillance near Shen Xi's house,

224
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,880
on the road tracking her car,

225
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,760
and near the woods

226
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,290
all match what Shen Xi said.

227
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,600
Plus this technical appraisal,

228
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,440
it's enough.

229
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:03,040
I think we can close the case.

230
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,360
Then write the report

231
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,080
and apply to close the case.

232
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,940
Okay, I'll get it done right away.

233
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:12,600
Wei,

234
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:15,280
what's up with Xiao Ze?

235
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,480
He stalked her for over a year,

236
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:18,760
but just days after getting out,

237
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:21,200
he was so desperate
he threatened her with his life.

238
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,480
This Shen Xi

239
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,080
is really charming.

240
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,010
What did you say?

241
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,440
I said Shen Xi is really charming.

242
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:30,560
No, no.

243
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,800
The sentence before that.

244
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:32,930
Previous sentence.

245
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,240
Why are you threatening suicide

246
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,880
so soon after getting out?

247
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:38,840
Right, Wei?

248
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,760
Isn't that what I said?

249
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,160
Yes, yes, yes.

250
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,240
Why is he in such a hurry?

251
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,640
Hold off on that report.

252
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:50,840
Let me think about it.

253
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,440
Wait for what?

254
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,120
How much longer do I have to wait?

255
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,850
You have to give me a timeframe.

256
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,440
Calm down, calm down.

257
00:12:59,040 --> 00:12:59,970
Have some water.

258
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:02,480
You still need to find out
the truth, right?

259
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,160
Li Xingchen,

260
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,080
do you know how much pressure I'm under

261
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,080
with this case open?

262
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,160
But...

263
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:10,700
Seven days.

264
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,760
I'll give you seven more days.

265
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,040
You must close the case.

266
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:14,900
Any questions?

267
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,800
No problem. Rest assured, sir.

268
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,010
Chu Ye

269
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,040
All right.

270
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,160
Brat.

271
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,260
Captain Li,

272
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:41,040
seven days. We only have seven days

273
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,400
to tail her.

274
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,130
This Shen Xi is something else.

275
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,920
She still dares to eat
at this hot pot place.

276
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,370
Isn't she traumatized?

277
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,360
I think

278
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,100
she's doing it on purpose.

279
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,640
We don't have any evidence anyway.

280
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,900
Just keep an eye on her.

281
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,450
How long do we have to watch her?

282
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,680
Until she finishes eating.

283
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,360
Xingchen,
my official performance is tomorrow.

284
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,220
Are you coming?

285
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,200
Of course.

286
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,400
I have to be there to support you.

287
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:23,680
Boss,

288
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,960
I know.

289
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:30,120
Three days left, right?

290
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,240
Copy that, Director Wu.

291
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:32,760
Got

292
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,360
it.

293
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,380
I'm hanging up now.

294
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,240
All right.

295
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,960
This dance drama is very touching.

296
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:49,560
It's about the director's rebellion
against the injustice of fate.

297
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:50,280
And look,

298
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:52,560
the male lead dancing
right now is the director.

299
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,720
He's so handsome.

300
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,800
He's amazing.

301
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,600
Then I'll have to watch closely.

302
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:32,960
Shen Xi,

303
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,280
she came to the show too.

304
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,400
Makes sense.

305
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,440
She's a dancer after all.

306
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:43,000
Looks like Xiao Ze guessed right
before he died.

307
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,920
Shen Xi wanted to see this show,

308
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,800
just not with him.

309
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,480
Looks so impressive.

310
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:01,890
I have something to do,
I'll be right back.

311
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,640
Why does today's performance

312
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:12,240
feel different again?

313
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,600
What's different?

314
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,440
The styling,

315
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,680
the moves...

316
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,040
it feels a bit weird.

317
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,360
Where is Shen Xi?

318
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:45,480
Is she hiding from me?

319
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:52,220
Hey, Xingchen. Where are you?

320
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:54,370
Come to the celebration party with us.

321
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,620
To celebrate the great success
of "Circle".

322
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:03,000
Cheers!

323
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:05,380
Cheers!

324
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,200
Excuse me.

325
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,130
Coming through.

326
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:08,599
Director, let me toast you.

327
00:17:08,599 --> 00:17:10,040
Okay, thanks.

328
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,480
Alright, alright. Take it easy.

329
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,720
Thanks for your hard work.

330
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:13,880
Great job, everyone.

331
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:14,640
Good job.

332
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:15,720
Don't drink too much.

333
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,400
One more.

334
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:19,770
Yanfei and I would like to toast everyone.

335
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,160
And then we'll

336
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,400
keep it going.

337
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,240
Keep up the good work.

338
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,079
It'll be better next time.

339
00:17:24,079 --> 00:17:24,880
By yourself?

340
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,599
Let's have a drink.

341
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:27,599
Wishing you

342
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,560
a successful performance.

343
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,400
I'm just a stagehand.

344
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,000
Look at them.

345
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,240
I'm so jealous.

346
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:38,080
Stagehands have their own value,

347
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:38,480
right?

348
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,360
They couldn't have performed
so smoothly without you.

349
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,600
Thank you for the encouragement.

350
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,460
And you are...?

351
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:45,160
I'm a friend of your Director Song,

352
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:45,800
man.

353
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,680
Just here to join the celebration.

354
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,240
Were you here for

355
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:55,960
that small-scale performance last time?

356
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:56,720
Yes,

357
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,580
I was there too.

358
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,880
I noticed the formation

359
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:00,740
was a bit different from today's.

360
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,440
You're quite observant.

361
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:07,000
Last time there were 25 people.

362
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,920
Today there are only 24.

